ADDITIONAL NOTICE / 附加声明

This tool assists a human who is browsing job postings in their own browser.
It does NOT perform automated crawling, pagination, request replay, CAPTCHA
solving, or circumvention of any technical protection measure. Users are
responsible for complying with the terms of service of any website they visit.

本工具用于辅助使用者在自己的浏览器中阅读岗位信息，不进行自动翻页、批量请求、
验证码绕过或任何技术措施规避。使用者需自行遵守所访问网站的用户协议。
